title: Nationalities
card-image: img/cards/nationalities.svg?v=2
subtitle: The Ukrainian Rada, Finland and Transcaucasia.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: coalition_affairs
view-if: nationalities_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; nationalities_timer = 4

The empire's peoples want autonomy or independence: the Ukrainian Central Rada, the Finnish Diet, the Georgians, who vote Menshevik, the Baltic peoples, the Muslims of the Volga and Central Asia.

- @rada: Recognise the Ukrainian Rada's autonomy.
- @finland: Let the Finnish Diet govern its own affairs.
- @caucasus: Support a federal Transcaucasia led by the Georgian Mensheviks.
- @unity: Insist on the unity of the Russian state until the Assembly meets.
- @easy_discard

@rada

How should it be carried out? Phased in, with compensation and negotiation, it will cost a resource, do less and anger less. By decree it will do all that it says, and its opponents will answer. And a party strong enough can pass it and enforce it against them.

- @rada_slow: Phase it in, with compensation and negotiation.
- @rada_decree: Pass it by decree, as written.
- @rada_force: Pass it by decree, and break any opposition by force.

@rada_slow
choose-if: resources >= 1
subtitle: Milder effects and little anger. Costs 1 resource.
unavailable-subtitle: We have nothing to pay the compensation with.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'slow', () => {
RO.boost(Q, {nations: 4});
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -4, right_threat: 2, rel_ally: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 3);
});
!}

The Rada is recognised as the government of Ukraine's autonomy. Three Kadet ministers have resigned over it. It was phased in slowly, with compensation where it was owed, and the opposition grumbled rather than raged.



@rada_decree
subtitle: The law as written. Its opponents will answer.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'decree', () => {
RO.boost(Q, {nations: 4});
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -4, right_threat: 2, rel_ally: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 3);
});
!}

The Rada is recognised as the government of Ukraine's autonomy. Three Kadet ministers have resigned over it.



@rada_force
choose-if: strength >= 18
subtitle: Chance of breaking its opponents: Kadets [+ odds_kad +]%, generals [+ odds_gen +]%. A camp under 45% is too strong to touch, and is left alone.
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the force and the allies to break the opposition.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'force', () => {
RO.boost(Q, {nations: 4});
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -4, right_threat: 2, rel_ally: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 3);
});
!}

The Rada is recognised as the government of Ukraine's autonomy. Three Kadet ministers have resigned over it. [+ law_text +]

@finland

How should it be carried out? Phased in, with compensation and negotiation, it will cost a resource, do less and anger less. By decree it will do all that it says, and its opponents will answer. And a party strong enough can pass it and enforce it against them.

- @finland_slow: Phase it in, with compensation and negotiation.
- @finland_decree: Pass it by decree, as written.
- @finland_force: Pass it by decree, and break any opposition by force.

@finland_slow
choose-if: resources >= 1
subtitle: Milder effects and little anger. Costs 1 resource.
unavailable-subtitle: We have nothing to pay the compensation with.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'slow', () => {
RO.boost(Q, {nations: 2});
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -2, right_threat: 1});
});
!}

The Finns are to govern their internal affairs. The question of independence is left for the Assembly. It was phased in slowly, with compensation where it was owed, and the opposition grumbled rather than raged.



